## Errors

| Symptom | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| Exit code 2, auth error | `{{ gws_bin }} auth login -s gmail` |
| `accessNotConfigured` | Enable Gmail API in GCP; wait ~10s and retry |
| Empty results | Verify label name; try broader query; check `in:sent` vs `in:inbox` |
| Too many scopes | Use `-s gmail` not full preset for unverified OAuth apps |
